@startuml Accepted Christs Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Accepted Christ — register a decision

actor "Teacher / Coordinator / Admin" as Client
participant AcceptedChristController as Controller
participant CreateAcceptedChristService as Service
participant GetChildrenService as Children
database "MySQL\nAcceptedChristRepository" as Repository
participant NotifyAcceptedChristService as Notify

Client -> Controller : POST /accepted-christs
Controller -> Service : access context + validated DTO
Service -> Service : assert role may register decisions
Service -> Children : find child within caller scope
Children --> Service : child or scoped not-found
Service -> Repository : create decision for child
Repository --> Service : saved decision
Service -> Notify : notify club team in background
Service --> Client : AcceptedChristResponseDto

note over Service, Notify
  Notes are stored but never e-mailed or logged.
  No club or no eligible recipient means no notification.
end note
@enduml
